<p>Australian Federal Police arrested former Special Air Service soldier Ben Roberts-Smith at Sydney Airport on April 7 and said he will face five counts of war crime murder over the alleged killing of five unarmed Afghans between 2009 and 2012 during deployments in Afghanistan. Police said the alleged victims were not taking part in hostilities, were detained and unarmed, and were under Australian Defence Force control when they were killed. Authorities also allege that some were shot by subordinates acting on Roberts-Smith’s orders and in his presence. The arrest marks a major step in Australia’s long-running effort to investigate alleged misconduct by its forces in Afghanistan. Roberts-Smith, a Victoria Cross recipient and Australia’s most decorated living soldier, has consistently denied wrongdoing.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/8kBLlOG57-VvkPRb01hhbr3-NE7yRhaK3pvmIg_B7baXUQFaPBmLP6tgV15gcpfbIywGUtzX8hrouhJBXMBRVac1y64fEUEv1e1aVi18rQ0a' alt='Ben Roberts-Smith arrives at the Federal Court of Australia in Sydney, May 18, 2022.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Maximum penalty: Each of the five war crime murder charges carries a maximum penalty of life imprisonment under Australian law.</li><li>Deployment history: Roberts-Smith served six tours in Afghanistan from 2006 to 2012, placing the allegations within a long stretch of repeated combat deployments.</li><li>Defamation fallout: In 2023, a Federal Court judge found that newspapers had proved four of six murder allegations against Roberts-Smith to the civil standard in his defamation suit, and his final appeal bid was later dismissed.</li></ul><blockquote>It will be alleged the victims were not taking part in hostilities at the time of their alleged murder in Afghanistan. - Krissy Barrett</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Australian Federal Police: AFP Commissioner Krissy Barrett said investigators will allege that some of the killings were carried out by subordinates acting on Roberts-Smith’s orders and in his presence, pointing to a case that examines both direct actions and responsibility for orders given in the field. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1989415/australias-most-decorated-soldier-ben-roberts-smith-arrested-over-alleged-war-crimes-in-afghanistan'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Ben Roberts-Smith: Roberts-Smith has consistently denied wrongdoing during his service, despite years of public allegations and court scrutiny. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/apr/07/ben-roberts-smith-arrested-brs-australian-soldier-sas-alleged-war-crimes-ntwnfb'>The Guardian</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1989415/australias-most-decorated-soldier-ben-roberts-smith-arrested-over-alleged-war-crimes-in-afghanistan'>Australia’s most decorated soldier Ben Roberts-Smith arrested over alleged war crimes in Afghanistan</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/australias-most-decorated-soldier-ben-roberts-smith-arrested-over-alleged-war-crimes/article70832923.ece'>Australia&#x27;s most decorated soldier Ben Roberts-Smith arrested over alleged war crimes</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/4/7/australian-soldier-ben-roberts-smith-arrested-over-alleged-war-crimes'>Australia arrests ex-soldier Roberts-Smith over alleged Afghan war crimes</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/australia-arrests-decorated-veteran-ben-roberts-smith-on-war-crimes-charges/a-76682712'>Australia arrests decorated veteran Ben Roberts-Smith on war crimes charges</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/former-australian-soldier-charged-committing-5-war-crime-131789288'>Former Australian soldier charged with committing 5 war crime murders in Afghanistan</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/australasia/article/3349228/decorated-australian-soldier-faces-5-murder-charges-afghan-war-crime-probe'>Decorated Australian soldier faces 5 murder charges in Afghan war crime probe</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/apr/07/australia-news-live-cyclone-maila-threat-queensland-road-toll-trump-iran-ntwnfb'>News live: Australians buy record number of new EVs in March; Australian War Memorial to review Ben Roberts-Smith display</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reuters.com/world/asia-pacific/australias-most-decorated-soldier-ben-roberts-smith-arrested-over-alleged-war-2026-04-07/'>Ben Roberts-Smith, a Australian Army veteran who won the Victoria Cross and other military honors, is arrested by Australian Federal Police at Sydney Airport in Sydney, Australia for alleged war crimes committed between 2009 and 2012 during his deployment in the War in Afghanistan.</a> - reuters.com</li></ul>